Source: metabase
Section: web
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Jake Bateman <jake.bateman@openfifth.co.uk>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: metabase
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, @JAVA_DEPENDS@, mariadb-common, mariadb-server, apache2, rsyslog, adduser
Description: Metabase open source analytics server
 Metabase OSS packaged for Open Fifth deployments.
 .
 This package installs the official upstream Metabase JAR together with the
 local Apache, rsyslog, environment and systemd integration used by Open Fifth.
